							\nabla^2\kernel^*(\eta_k)
							u^k
						}{
							u^k
						}
					}.
				\end{align}
				Since \(\kernel\) is twice continuously differentiable with \(\nabla^2\kernel\succ0\) on \(C\), and \(\K\subset C\) is compact and convex, one has that
				\[
